{"title":"1991 AJHSME Problems/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The vertical axis indicates the number of employees, but the scale was accidentally omitted from this graph.  What percent of the employees at the Gauss company have worked there for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years or more?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/0/de076da1d134dd8be58ce99efedbd7b3a31e483b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] for(int a=1; a&lt;11; ++a)  {   draw((a,0)--(a,-.5));  } draw((0,10.5)--(0,0)--(10.5,0)); label(&quot;$1$&quot;,(1,-.5),S); label(&quot;$2$&quot;,(2,-.5),S); label(&quot;$3$&quot;,(3,-.5),S); label(&quot;$4$&quot;,(4,-.5),S);  label(&quot;$5$&quot;,(5,-.5),S); label(&quot;$6$&quot;,(6,-.5),S); label(&quot;$7$&quot;,(7,-.5),S); label(&quot;$8$&quot;,(8,-.5),S); label(&quot;$9$&quot;,(9,-.5),S); label(&quot;$10$&quot;,(10,-.5),S); label(&quot;Number of years with company&quot;,(5.5,-2),S); label(&quot;X&quot;,(1,0),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(1,1),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(1,2),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(1,3),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(1,4),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(2,0),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(2,1),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(2,2),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(2,3),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(2,4),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(3,0),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(3,1),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(3,2),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(3,3),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(3,4),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(3,5),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(3,6),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(3,7),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(4,0),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(4,1),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(4,2),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(5,0),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(5,1),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(6,0),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(6,1),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(7,0),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(7,1),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(8,0),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(9,0),N); label(&quot;X&quot;,(10,0),N); label(&quot;Gauss Company&quot;,(5.5,10),N); [/asy]\" width=\"275\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/6/996d64a2de3b87905edc8c9bd32befd876f5d544.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 9\\% \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 23\\frac{1}{3}\\% \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 30\\% \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 42\\frac{6}{7}\\% \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"468\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> be the number of employees represented by each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae5f1c3bb5ee22198c136ad4cc3dda97286f0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{X}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />.  The graph has a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae5f1c3bb5ee22198c136ad4cc3dda97286f0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{X}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />'s, while the columns corresponding to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> or more years at the company have a combined <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4ae5f1c3bb5ee22198c136ad4cc3dda97286f0d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{X}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />'s.  So of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/9/5f9dc28774bf791d7f910d56b60b67a300d5ec6f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" /> employees, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/354fe2e85d24b20d964aff45a4d4774ba4baaa3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9x$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> have worked at the company for at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> years, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/3/5c335589fa4ea4501f0894752af3e7c188870392.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{9x}{30x} = \\frac{3}{10} = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\ 30\\%}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"184\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1991_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-alig